   "conditions": [
    "Assumption 4.6: minimum separation between change-points (nu_1 >= m_1, nu_k - nu_{k-1} >= l_{k-1} + m_k)",
    "detector D satisfies Property 4.1 (latency + pre-change window O(log T + log(1/delta_F) + log(1/delta_D)))",
    "stationary algorithm regret R_B concave and increasing in T with R_B(T) = O~(d^p gamma_T^q (|A| log|Pi|)^r sqrt(T))",
    "N_T (S_T) is the number of change-points"
